      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey help... i just spilled boiling water on my arm and it's really bad. its all red and there are these huge blisters starting to form and it's stinging like crazy. i rly dont want to go to the er if i can help it... can i just put some thick honey or maybe some heavy coconut oil on it to soothe the burn and keep it from getting gross? i'm trying to keep things natural if i can.",
